鏄�锛岀幇鍦ㄨ繖涓�濂藉儚宸茬粡鍚撲笉浜嗗ス浜嗐�傜湡鏄�鍙�绗戯紝濂圭珶鐒惰��涓�涓�浠庢湭瑙佽繃闈㈢殑鐢蜂汉澶轰簡蹇冩櫤锛岄夯鐥逛簡銆�"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "美人之棋步天下", "content_zh": "第七章 意外而来的消息“扑哧扑哧”齐琳仔细的想着，只能想到两个可能。第一，追杀上次的那个黑衣人的人进来搜山。第二，有其他的更为厉害的动物进来了。但是她很快又将两者完全否决，因为就算是要搜山，也因该是第二天一大早，越快越好，除非已经确定目标已经死亡，要不就是那个黑衣人没有什么重要，只是一般的小贼。其次，要是有什么不得了的动物进来的话，绝对不仅仅是鸟飞了，恐怕整座山都会充满狼嚎吧，除非，狼群全部都死了。正因为两个最合理的推测都不可能，齐琳才决定出去看个究竟。不过关键时刻，小白却不见了。今天一醒来就没有发现小白，她没有让狼群出去找，以来相信小白的实力，而来担心出去的狼群出现什么意外，所以她这次出来只是带了十匹狼。“奇了怪了，往日只是在外面就能够听见狼嚎，可是今日怎么走了这么久都不曾见到一只？就连声音都没听到？”一个瘦高的男子说道，取下腰间的水壶喝下两大口，看了看四周，继续埋怨道“别说狼了。就连蛇都没有。”“年轻人，不要太心急了。你是不知道这林子的危险，越安静，就越危险。”梁虎擦了擦汗水，继续抬步走着，其实他也好奇，为什么一路走来都没有遇到狼群？就算是躲到深山中，也不可能这么快，像是消失了一样。秦潇从大树上往下看去，除了野草还是野草。就是没有狼的身影。若不是亲身受过狼群的围攻，他恐怕会不相信这里有狼的。不知道其他的人有什么发现。秦潇微提一口气，轻轻地从树枝上落地，几乎没有发出一点声响，掸了掸身上的树叶，继续往前走，却不料被人按住肩膀，秦潇暗自在手中运气，准备打飞这个人，却听见梁虎说话。“这位壮士好身手。”从一开始就已经感觉到此人身手不凡，而且这身行头也不像是猎人，梁虎松开手走到秦潇的面前，面露微笑道“只不过，从这里开始，树都变得繁茂起来，想必是毒蛇的势力，还是小心为妙。”秦潇看着梁虎，他还是相信这个人的实力的，不然一路走来。那些山野莽夫若是没有他的提醒，恐怕还没找到妖女，就已经被毒花毒草毒死了。所以还是放下了将军的架子，走到梁虎的身后，仔细的观察着周遭的一切，若是有个风吹草动，他第一个就冲上去。“嗖嗖”忽然从旁边的杂草传来一阵响动，所有的猎人都准备好弓箭刀枪，紧紧的盯着那个地方。齐琳用棍子将足足有她高的杂草打折，劈出一条路来。却忽然听见前面有一阵响动，身边的　狼都警惕起来，紧紧的盯着前方。会是小白吗？狼群的反应倒像是见了敌人一样，难道是其他的狼群？齐琳后退了几步，她只有是匹狼，打起来的话是打不赢的，打不赢只有跑了。齐琳慢慢的转身，对着狼群做了一个跑的手势，狼群虽然很疑惑，却也跟着跑起来。齐琳也跟着跑起来。“谁？”秦潇眼疾手快的一个跃身，拔出腰间长剑，劈开杂草，长剑准确无误的抵在来人的脖子上，要是他微微一动，此人必死无疑。“嗷呜~~”齐琳眨眨眼睛，看着全身是杂草的小白，还有它口中的那头???野猪，有些哭笑不得。“好汉饶命，好汉饶命。”见秦潇杀气凌然，两人颤抖的跪下求饶。秦潇见两人只是普通的猎户，而且十分眼熟，不就是前两日见到的山中猎户么？他们也加入了？迅速的收回长剑，转身不打算理会。却被一下子抓住脚，秦潇厌恶的回头，冷冷道“不想活了？”“想，想活下去。”其中一人抬起头，看着秦潇，却死都不放开手，跪着爬到秦潇的脚边，死命的磕头“小人只想跟着好汉。”“小人也是。”另一个也是爬上来拉着秦潇的衣袍，拼命的磕头。秦潇见两人也算聪明，没有摆出他的身份。“小人名叫将离，曾经被好汉救过一命，希望做牛做马报答好汉的恩情。”将离真诚的双眼布满了血丝，想来是几天没有睡好。却依然掩藏不住他眼中的坚定。“小人是贯众，也希望能够报答好汉的救命之恩。”贯众是跟着哥哥而来，那日也是被秦潇所救，秦潇的为人打动了他，他也一样要和大哥一样，为秦潇效劳。秦潇一时也不好多说什么，再耽搁下去，想必梁虎又要说什么大道理了。只好默许两人跟着。野猪已经被狼四分五裂，齐琳就靠在树枝上打理着小白身上的残叶。没想到小白也会出去打猎，而且一出手就是野猪，那可是会杀死人的东东啊。害她白担心了一场。不过。残叶倒是好打理，但是小白几乎像是从污泥中走过一样。污泥已经没过脚背，雪白的毛发也变成了土黄色，看上去就像是经历了北京的沙尘暴一样。齐琳小心翼翼的扯下黏在小白身上的一块黄色的东西，这块污泥算是最大了的吧，无奈的看看正在挠痒痒的小白，她都怀疑小白近视眼，误将泥潭当做水潭，跑到里面洗了个澡，然后刚好占了野猪大大的地盘，两人就滚泥潭了。想到这样的场景，齐琳不禁想起隔壁的猫和狗打架的场景，一不小心笑了出来。小白和狼群都看着齐琳，小白将沾满泥水的头朝着齐琳的脸蹭了蹭，弄得齐琳满身都是泥水。然后再睁着无辜的大眼睛看着齐琳。鼻子传来一阵奇痒，小白低下头用爪子企图将那东西弄下来，却碰了一鼻子灰。真是的，想发作又不合适，齐琳将手中的污泥丢向小白，却粘在小白的鼻子那里，好像是一条大大的毛毛虫，很是滑稽。“哈哈??哈哈哈。”齐琳捂住肚子笑出了声，小白的样子就像是拱到了大便一样。一时间。一阵银铃般的笑声充满了树林，就连飞走的鸟儿都不禁多看了几眼。笑够了之后齐琳才打算帮小白取下东西，可是当拿到那东西的时候，齐琳发现手感不对，污泥的粘合性没有这么好。这怎么看都像是一块布。怎么会呢？四处看了看，齐琳叫上小白穿过茂密的草丛。来到一处小溪，将手中的东西小心的洗干净，终于露出了明黄色的布料。齐琳撑开布料仔细的看着，却发现这上面的字是历史上没有出现过的。奇怪的是，她看得懂。看来穿越定律中，穿越者都会具备识别这个地方文字语言的能力，是真的。可是，当看到上面的内容之后，齐琳倒真的笑不出来了。上面明明确确的写着，召集全国猎人，进入白虎山，围剿妖女。妖女。白虎山。齐琳抬头看了看高耸于这片森林的那座山，自上而下，数目逐渐减少，到最高点的时候只被白雪覆盖，从这个方向看，还真的像一只正在休息的白虎。如果这座山叫做白虎的话，那么妖女???是指她自己么？可是她一向小心，都不让外人看到她，难道是那个黑衣人???齐琳握紧手中的告示，她总算是知道林中的鸟儿为什么如此不安，敢情是在抓她啊，还是妖女！被抓到之后是不是要浸猪笼？火刑？还是千刀万剐？还是游街示众？或者????被祀奉起来？想到这些可能性，齐琳咧开嘴笑起来。小白看着岸上的齐琳一个人傻笑，歪着头，继续洗澡。“别说狼了，就连狼毛都没看见一根。”说完，男子便伸手在水中洗了一下，冰冷的溪水透过指尖传入，男子打了一个寒颤，却还是忍不住洗了一把脸，继续说道“干脆猎一两只野兔回去的了。”“猎人最忌讳的就是心急，兄台安心寻找便是，说不定????。”“别说话。”梁虎警惕的捂住说话人的嘴巴，竖起耳朵听着周围的声音。秦潇几个翻转便来到了离小溪不远的高树上，目光由远及近。屏气凝神，目光由远及近，像猎豹一样寻找着四周。随身的几个人都疑惑的看着他们两个，除了风声鸟叫声，其他什么声音都没有。但是秦潇和梁虎听得见，那是断断续续的，如流水般快活的笑声。在那边。梁虎和秦潇同时看向同一个方向，然后风一般的冲过去。只要抓住这个人，不管她是妖女还是谁，只要压到皇上的面前，他一定会下命令围剿白虎山的。只要引起皇上的注意的话，就算这里曾经是那个人最喜欢的地方，也一定会下命令的。想到这里，秦潇迅速的运转体内力量，整个人腾空而起，飞快的穿过树木藤条。凤长卿站在凤凰池旁，一袭红衣随风飘扬，面朝白虎山方向，嘴角挂着淡淡笑意。身后是戴着夜叉面具的男子，显然是个祭司。妖女，他从来都不信。不过???这件事情，倒是勾起了他的兴趣。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/meirenzhiqibutianxia/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 7 Unexpected news \"Puch, plop\" Qi Lin thought carefully and could only think of two possibilities. First, the people who were chasing the man in black from last time came in to search the mountain. Second, other more powerful animals came in. But she quickly rejected both of them completely, because even if she wanted to search the mountain, it would be early the next morning, and the sooner the better, unless it was already confirmed that the target was dead, or the man in black was not important and was just an ordinary thief. Secondly, if any serious animals come in, it will definitely not just be birds flying, but the whole mountain will be filled with howling wolves, unless all the wolves are dead. It was precisely because the two most reasonable speculations were impossible that Qi Lin decided to go out and see what happened. But at the critical moment, Xiaobai disappeared. When she woke up today, she didn't find Xiao Bai. She didn't let the wolves go out to look for him. She believed in Xiao Bai's strength, but was worried about something unexpected happening to the wolves that went out, so she only brought ten wolves with her this time. \"It's strange. In the past, you could hear wolves howling just outside, but why haven't you seen one after walking for so long today? Didn't you even hear the sound?\" said a tall and thin man. He took off the water bottle from his waist and drank two large sips. He looked around and continued to complain. \"Don't talk about wolves. There aren't even snakes.\" \"Young man, don't be too impatient. You don't know the dangers in this forest. The quieter, the more dangerous it is.\" Liang Hu wiped his sweat and continued walking. In fact, he was also curious as to why he didn't encounter wolves along the way. Even if he hid in the mountains, he wouldn't be able to disappear so quickly. Qin Xiao looked down from the big tree and saw nothing but weeds. There is just no sign of the wolf. If he hadn't been attacked by wolves himself, he might not believe that there were wolves here. I don't know what other people have discovered. Qin Xiao took a slight breath, landed gently from the branch, barely making a sound, dusted the leaves on his body, and continued to walk forward, but unexpectedly someone pressed his shoulder. Qin Xiao secretly felt lucky in his hands and was about to fight this person away, but heard Liang Hu speak. \"This strong man is very skilled.\" From the beginning, he had felt that this man was extraordinary, and he did not look like a hunter in his outfit. Liang Hu let go of his hand and walked in front of Qin Xiao, smiling and said, \"It's just that from here on, the trees became lush. It must be the power of poisonous snakes, so it's better to be careful.\" Qin Xiao looked at Liang Hu, he still believed in this man's strength, otherwise he would have walked all the way. If those wild men in the mountains had not been warned by him, they would have been poisoned by poisonous flowers and poisonous weeds before they even found the witch. So he put down his airs as a general and walked behind Liang Hu, carefully observing everything around him. If there was any trouble, he would be the first to rush forward. \"Whoosh!\" Suddenly there was a sound from the weeds nearby. All the hunters prepared their bows, arrows, swords and guns, and stared at that place closely. Qi Lin used a stick to break the weeds that were as tall as her and cut a path. But suddenly they heard a noise in front of them, and the wolves around them became alert and stared straight ahead. Could it be Xiaobai? The wolves reacted as if they had seen an enemy. Could it be another wolf pack? Qi Lin took a few steps back. She was only a wolf, and she couldn't win in a fight. If she couldn't win, she would have to run away. Qi Lin slowly turned around and made a running gesture towards the wolves. Although the wolves were confused, they also started running. Qi Lin also started running. \"Who?\" Qin Xiao jumped up with quick eyes and hands, pulled out the long sword from his waist, and chopped the weeds. The long sword was accurately pressed against the person's neck. If he moved even slightly, the person would definitely die. \"Ouch~~\" Qi Lin blinked her eyes and looked at Xiaobai, who was covered in weeds, and the??? wild boar in his mouth, a little dumbfounded. \"Hero, spare your life, hero, spare your life.\" Seeing Qin Xiao's murderous intent, the two of them knelt down tremblingly and begged for mercy. Qin Xiao saw that the two were just ordinary hunters, and they looked very familiar. Aren't they the same hunters in the mountains that they had seen two days ago? Did they join in too? He quickly retracted his sword and turned around, ignoring it. But his feet were grabbed suddenly. Qin Xiao turned around in disgust and said coldly, \"Don't want to live?\" \"Yes, I want to live.\" One of them raised his head and looked at Qin Xiao, but refused to let go. He knelt and crawled to Qin Xiao's feet, kowtowing desperately, \"The villain just wants to follow the hero.\" \"The villain does the same.\" The other one also climbed up and pulled Qin Xiao's robe, kowtowing desperately. Qin Xiao saw that the two of them were smart and did not reveal his identity. \"The villain's name is Jiang Li. He was once saved by a hero. I hope to repay the hero's kindness by doing something like a cow or a horse.\" Jiang Li's sincere eyes were filled with bloodshot eyes. He must have not slept well for several days. But he still couldn't hide the determination in his eyes. \"The villain is Guan Zhong, and he also hopes to repay the hero for saving his life.\" Guan Zhong came with his brother, and was also rescued by Qin Xiao that day. Qin Xiao's character moved him, and he also wanted to serve Qin Xiao like his elder brother. Qin Xiao couldn't say much at the moment. If he delayed any longer, Liang Hu would probably say something big again. He had no choice but to acquiesce to the two of them following. The wild boar had been torn apart by the wolf, and Qi Lin was leaning on the branch to take care of the remaining leaves on Xiao Bai's body. Unexpectedly, Xiaobai would also go out hunting, and the first time he took action was a wild boar, it was something that could kill people. It made her worry in vain. but. The remaining leaves were easy to take care of, but Xiaobai almost looked like he was walking through mud. The mud has reached the top of the feet, and the snow-white hair has turned khaki. It looks like it has experienced a sandstorm in Beijing. Qi Lin carefully pulled off a piece of yellow stuff stuck to Xiao Bai's body. This piece of sludge was probably the largest. She looked helplessly at Xiao Bai who was scratching his itch. She suspected that Xiao Bai was short-sighted and mistakenly mistook the mire for a water pool. She ran inside and took a bath, and then happened to occupy a large area of ​​the wild boar.", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}